<title>USA: Shell contracts J. Ray McDermott barge.</title>
<headline>Shell contracts J. Ray McDermott barge.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shell Deepwater Development Inc, a unit of Royal Dutch/Shell Group, has contracted J. Ray McDermott Inc's Derrick Barge 50 for two years.</p>
<p>The barge's thrust system and pipeline installation system will be modified for the contract in the deepwater Gulf of Mexico, McDermott said.</p>
<p>J. Ray McDermott is majority owned by McDermott International Inc.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsroom 212 859 1902))</p>
</text>
